    "detailed_description": "This is a short peaceful RPG. You will visit villages without spring. You can only joke, dance, stare, run away and hug. You must go to \u201cYomotsuku mountain\u201d to see your precious.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sparkling winter world depicted in pixel art<br></li><li>Simple gameplay (just walk, battle, and eat cookies!)<br></li><li>On your turn, use five commands and see how your opponent reacts (and end the battle peacefully).<br></li><li>On your opponent's turn, press the arrow keys at the right moment to guard against attacks. (Press &quot;T&quot;, &quot;C&quot;, &quot;K&quot;, and &quot;W&quot; simultaneously to switch to &quot;invulnerability mode&quot;, which does not result in game over.)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "This is a short peaceful RPG. You will visit villages without spring. You can only joke, dance, stare, run away and hug. You must go to \u201cYomotsuku mountain\u201d to see your precious.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sparkling winter world depicted in pixel art<br></li><li>Simple gameplay (just walk, battle, and eat cookies!)<br></li><li>On your turn, use five commands and see how your opponent reacts (and end the battle peacefully).<br></li><li>On your opponent's turn, press the arrow keys at the right moment to guard against attacks. (Press &quot;T&quot;, &quot;C&quot;, &quot;K&quot;, and &quot;W&quot; simultaneously to switch to &quot;invulnerability mode&quot;, which does not result in game over.)</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is a short peaceful RPG. Your only commands are &quot;joke&quot;, &quot;dance&quot;, &quot;stare&quot;, &quot;run away&quot;, and &quot;hug&quot;.",
